{
  "schemaVersion": "story-package-beat-module/0.1",
  "package": {
    "id": "taixu-relics-part1",
    "version": "0.1.0"
  },
  "chapter": {
    "id": "chapter-031",
    "title": "天门初鸣"
  },
  "beat": {
    "id": "beat_chapter_172",
    "nodeId": "node_source_continuity",
    "summary": "陆照临把无名小灯递给她：“先让他停下。”",
    "narrativeBrief": [
      {
        "text": "第三盏灯点亮后，回川城只剩一夜。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-001",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5445,
          "end": 5445
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "城中所有姓名牌同时变成空白，街上的人却没有立刻消失。他们仍能走、能说话、能认出自己的屋子，只是每当有人叫出一个名字，声音便会被钟楼的青光吞掉。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-002",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5447,
          "end": 5447
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临站在塔顶，手里的无名小灯没有点燃。第一盏、第二盏和第三盏灯围着他缓慢旋转，灯火交错，像三条互相纠缠的锁链。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-003",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5449,
          "end": 5449
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "慧闻从楼梯上来，脸色苍白：“封天令还能撑多久？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-004",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5451,
          "end": 5451
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“到子时。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-005",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5453,
          "end": 5453
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“现在距离子时还有两个时辰。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-006",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5455,
          "end": 5455
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“够救多少人？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-007",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5457,
          "end": 5457
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“看你愿意让谁记住自己。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-008",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5459,
          "end": 5459
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临回头看城内。顾长离正在街心分发铜针，让居民把针尾缺口对准自己的屋门。叶观澜带着几名归墟盟成员守住东门，阻止玄霄宗的封锁队伍进入。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-009",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5461,
          "end": 5461
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你们准备怎么做？”慧闻问。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-010",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5463,
          "end": 5463
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“让人离开。”陆照临说。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-011",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5465,
          "end": 5465
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“离开城，记忆会在路上崩散。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-012",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5467,
          "end": 5467
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“留在城里呢？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-013",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5469,
          "end": 5469
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“成为封天令的锚。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-014",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5471,
          "end": 5471
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“总要有选择。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-015",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5473,
          "end": 5473
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "慧闻把无相铜镜递给他：“镜子可以把一段记忆留在城外，但只能留一段。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-016",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5475,
          "end": 5475
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“留谁的？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-017",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5477,
          "end": 5477
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“由你决定。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-018",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5479,
          "end": 5479
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "钟楼下传来争吵。一个老人抱着孩子，指着顾长离喊：“她拿走了我的名字！”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-019",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5481,
          "end": 5481
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "顾长离没有辩解，只把铜针递回老人手里：“我没有拿。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-020",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5483,
          "end": 5483
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“那为什么我记不得自己是谁？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-021",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5485,
          "end": 5485
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“因为有人替你做了选择。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-022",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5487,
          "end": 5487
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "老人抬头看钟楼：“那你们为什么不把名字还回来？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-023",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5489,
          "end": 5489
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "顾长离看向陆照临：“因为还不回去。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-024",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5491,
          "end": 5491
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临把无相铜镜贴在钟楼石栏上。镜面浮出一条条名字，有的完整，有的只剩姓氏。最下方出现一个熟悉的名字：陆沉舟。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-025",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5493,
          "end": 5493
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“他在城心。”慧闻说。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-026",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5495,
          "end": 5495
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你确定？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-027",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5497,
          "end": 5497
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“镜子只照记忆，不照时间。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-028",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5499,
          "end": 5499
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“可它一直在照他。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-029",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5501,
          "end": 5501
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“因为你一直在记他。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-030",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5503,
          "end": 5503
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "第三盏灯的火焰忽然向外爆开，城中一半房屋的门同时打开。失名的人走出屋子，朝钟楼缓慢聚拢。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-031",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5505,
          "end": 5505
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "叶观澜在东门大喊：“玄霄宗开始攻城！”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-032",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5507,
          "end": 5507
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "剑光穿过夜色，落在城墙上。灰袍修士带着十余名弟子进入城门，白玉令牌上浮出封天令的三方印记。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-033",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5509,
          "end": 5509
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“陆照临，封天令即将失效。”他喊，“交还残印，玄霄宗会保存回川城居民的记忆。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-034",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5511,
          "end": 5511
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“保存在哪里？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-035",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5513,
          "end": 5513
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“宗门的记忆库。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-036",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5515,
          "end": 5515
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“谁能保证他们拿得回来？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-037",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5517,
          "end": 5517
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "灰袍修士沉默了一瞬：“宗门。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-038",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5519,
          "end": 5519
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "叶观澜冷笑：“又是宗门。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-039",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5521,
          "end": 5521
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "灰袍修士挥剑，弟子们结成阵势。剑光所过，居民纷纷倒地，身体没有受伤，眼神却变得茫然。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-040",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5523,
          "end": 5523
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“借火者，先还一名。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-053",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5549,
          "end": 5549
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“我还谁？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-054",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5551,
          "end": 5551
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“最先被你忘记的人。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-055",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5553,
          "end": 5553
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临脑中浮出一张模糊的脸。那不是父亲，也不是母亲，而是北河城一个卖灯油的老人。他曾在陆照临七岁时送过他一根灯芯。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-056",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5555,
          "end": 5555
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临想不起老人的名字。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-057",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5557,
          "end": 5557
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“不。”他说。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-058",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5559,
          "end": 5559
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "青光屏障立刻裂开。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-059",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5561,
          "end": 5561
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "顾长离冲到他身边：“不能拒绝？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-060",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5563,
          "end": 5563
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“我不替它选。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-061",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5565,
          "end": 5565
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“那就自己选。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-062",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5567,
          "end": 5567
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "她将一枚铜针刺入自己肩头。债契黑纹被铜针截断，鲜血顺着针尾流下，在地面画出一个顾氏旧印。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-063",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5569,
          "end": 5569
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“拿我的名字。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-064",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5571,
          "end": 5571
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临猛然看她：“你会被彻底抹掉。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-065",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5573,
          "end": 5573
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“我还没还完债。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-066",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5575,
          "end": 5575
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你叔父留下的债不该由你——”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-067",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5577,
          "end": 5577
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“现在由我决定。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-068",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5579,
          "end": 5579
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "顾长离拔出铜针，旧印在地面燃起蓝火。蓝火冲入第三盏灯，灯火立刻变得稳定。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-069",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5581,
          "end": 5581
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "城中居民的姓名牌开始恢复，先恢复姓氏，再恢复名字。老人抱紧孩子，终于喊出孩子的名字，却发现自己仍然想不起自己的。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-070",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5583,
          "end": 5583
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“顾长离！”陆照临再次喊。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-071",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5585,
          "end": 5585
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你不是他。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-041",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5737,
          "end": 5737
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“我是他被留下的部分。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-042",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5739,
          "end": 5739
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你还记得自己的名字吗？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-043",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5741,
          "end": 5741
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "男人沉默。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-044",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5743,
          "end": 5743
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "顾长离将铜针抵在他胸口：“说出来。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-045",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5745,
          "end": 5745
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“顾……长……”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-046",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5747,
          "end": 5747
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "最后一个字没有出现。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-047",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5749,
          "end": 5749
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "债契黑纹从顾长离颈侧重新生长，向那道影子缠去。影子没有躲，任由黑纹穿过身体。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-048",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5751,
          "end": 5751
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你的名字缺一笔。”顾长离说。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-049",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5753,
          "end": 5753
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“所以我回来找你。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-050",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5755,
          "end": 5755
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "她抬起铜针，却迟迟没有刺下。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-051",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5757,
          "end": 5757
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临把无名小灯递给她：“先让他停下。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-052",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5759,
          "end": 5759
        }
      }
    ],
